            "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Em um mundo pós-apocalíptico, onde as máquinas dominaram o planeta, os humanos que sobraram agora lutam para sobreviver, caçados por patrulhas robóticas opressoras. Lute, hackeie e seja a resistência: a esperança da humanidade está em suas mãos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740360/extras/469184fd2ad43deb05c1dde032e0095b.avif?t=1791387371\" width=1170 height=88 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740360/extras/d88ee2e9702bdb6d618214fb50e7931c.poster.avif?t=1791387371\" width=1170 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740360/extras/d88ee2e9702bdb6d618214fb50e7931c.webm?t=1791387371\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740360/extras/d88ee2e9702bdb6d618214fb50e7931c.mp4?t=1791387371\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construa seu ritmo de gameplay alternando entre um arsenal colossal de armas devastadoras. Vai de sniper e katana para a precisão mortal… ou prefere abraçar o caos com uma bazuca em mãos? Desbloqueie dezenas de power-ups, monte builds únicas e combine infinitas possibilidades até que os robôs não passem de sucata amassada.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740360/extras/a42ba5b9771e7f66a118abd5c1bec42d.avif?t=1791387371\" width=1170 height=88 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740360/extras/c0fe114b50287836942a30e565d3df76.poster.avif?t=1791387371\" width=1170 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740360/extras/c0fe114b50287836942a30e565d3df76.webm?t=1791387371\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740360/extras/c0fe114b50287836942a30e565d3df76.mp4?t=1791387371\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invada diferentes complexos, cada um com inimigos e chefões mais desafiadores e… singulares. Uma mãe-robô superprotetora que confunde amor com destruição em massa? Temos. Um robô de segway tentando bancar o segurança de shopping? Também temos. Dinossauros robóticos famintos em pleno zoológico pós-apocalíptico? Claro que sim. Tens o que é preciso para esmagar essas latas?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740360/extras/8015a09485e65adf29e16d09b43dc27b.avif?t=1791387371\" width=1170 height=88 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740360/extras/e69b9148622f12cb301ab1e92ed9893e.poster.avif?t=1791387371\" width=1170 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740360/extras/e69b9148622f12cb301ab1e92ed9893e.webm?t=1791387371\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740360/extras/e69b9148622f12cb301ab1e92ed9893e.mp4?t=1791387371\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Impeça os robôs de monetizarem com vídeos hipnotizantes de gatos fofinhos. Liberte os peludinhos das amarras do algoritmo e tenha o apoio vitalício de um exército felino inteiro.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740360/extras/7facbed0cdcc56db238009519ad94127.avif?t=1791387371\" width=1170 height=88 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740360/extras/5de4f9787624a219bd09dedc830c5ad0.poster.avif?t=1791387371\" width=1170 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740360/extras/5de4f9787624a219bd09dedc830c5ad0.webm?t=1791387371\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740360/extras/5de4f9787624a219bd09dedc830c5ad0.mp4?t=1791387371\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Descubra os segredos por trás da sociedade dos robôs, onde a jornada de trabalho não tem limite e as propagandas menos ainda. Burle o sistema de CAPTCHA altamente vigoroso e prove que você é mais inteligente que uma IA. Lute para que a Terra não seja dominada por todo esse spam!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740360/extras/c0424b37cd7394ae7dda474f69ae15bb.avif?t=1791387371\" width=1170 height=88 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
